                <div class="form-group">
                    <label style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600;">Reglas o políticas especiales (Opcional)</label>
                    <input type="text" id="genPromptRules" placeholder="Ej: Horario 19 a 00hs, envío gratis > $800, aceptamos MercadoPago y efectivo." style="width: 100%; padding: 8px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); background: var(--bg-input); color: var(--text-primary);">
                </div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top: 20px; display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 10px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding-top: 12px;">
                <button type="button" class="btn-secondary" onclick="closePromptGeneratorModal()">Cancelar</button>
                <button type="button" id="btnGeneratePromptSubmit" class="btn-primary" onclick="generateAiPromptSubmit()" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6); border: none;">🪄 Generar Prompt</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Modal: Ayuda para compartir Google Sheet -->
    <div id="sheetsHelpModal" class="chat-modal-overlay" style="display: none;">
        <div class="chat-modal-content" style="max-width: 560px; width: 92%; text-align: left;">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding-bottom: 12px;">
                <h3 style="margin: 0; color: var(--text-primary); font-size: 1.2rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                    <span>📖</span> Cómo compartir tu Google Sheet
                </h3>
                <button type="button" onclick="closeSheetsHelpModal()" style="background: transparent; border: none; font-size: 1.2rem; cursor: pointer; color: var(--text-primary);">✕</button>
            </div>

            <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--text-primary);">
                <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px;">
                    <div style="width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent-primary); color: white; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0;">1</div>
                    <div>
                        <strong>Abrí tu planilla en Google Sheets:</strong><br>
                        En la esquina superior derecha, hacé clic en el botón verde <strong>"Compartir"</strong>.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px;">
                    <div style="width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent-primary); color: white; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0;">2</div>
                    <div>
                        <strong>Cambiá el acceso general:</strong><br>
                        En la sección <em>Acceso general</em>, cambiá de "Restringido" a <strong>"Cualquier persona con el enlace"</strong>.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px;">
                    <div style="width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent-primary); color: white; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0;">3</div>
                    <div>
                        <strong>Verificá el rol de Lector:</strong><br>
                        Asegurate de que el rol a la derecha esté configurado como <strong>"Lector"</strong> (no es necesario dar permisos de editor).
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px;">
                    <div style="width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent-primary); color: white; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0;">4</div>
                    <div>
                        <strong>Copiá el enlace y pegalo:</strong><br>
                        Hacé clic en <strong>"Copiar enlace"</strong> y pegalo en el campo de texto en este panel.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div style="padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--bg-input); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); font-size: 0.85rem;">
                    💡 <strong>Columnas recomendadas:</strong> Nombre, Precio, Categoría, Descripción, Disponible (Sí/No).
                </div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top: 20px; display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding-top: 12px;">
                <button type="button" class="btn-primary" onclick="closeSheetsHelpModal()">Entendido</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Mobile Drawer Navigation Overlay & Panel -->
    <div class="admin-drawer-overlay" id="adminDrawerOverlay" onclick="closeAdminDrawer()"></div>
    <aside class="admin-drawer" id="adminDrawer" aria-label="Menú Lateral Completo">
        <div class="drawer-header">
            <div class="drawer-brand">
                <div class="drawer-logo-icon">🏪</div>
                <div class="drawer-brand-text">
                    <span class="drawer-store-title"><%= store ? store.name : 'WaBot' %></span>
                    <span class="drawer-store-sub">Panel de Administración</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <button type="button" class="drawer-close-btn" onclick="closeAdminDrawer()" aria-label="Cerrar menú">✕</button>
        </div>

        <div class="drawer-body">
            <!-- Grupo: Catálogo y Oferta -->
            <div class="drawer-group">
                <span class="drawer-group-title">CATÁLOGO & OFERTA</span>
                <button type="button" class="drawer-item active" data-tab="products" onclick="switchTabAndCloseDrawer('products')">
                    <span class="drawer-item-icon">📦</span>
                    <span class="drawer-item-text">Productos</span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="drawer-item drawer-clinic-item" data-tab="services" onclick="switchTabAndCloseDrawer('services')" id="drawer-tab-services" style="<%= (store && store.clinic_mode === 1) ? '' : 'display: none;' %>">
                    <span class="drawer-item-icon">⚕️</span>
                    <span class="drawer-item-text">Servicios</span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="drawer-item drawer-hostel-item" data-tab="rooms" onclick="switchTabAndCloseDrawer('rooms')" id="drawer-tab-rooms" style="<%= (store && store.hostel_mode === 1) ? '' : 'display: none;' %>">
                    <span class="drawer-item-icon">🛏️</span>
                    <span class="drawer-item-text">Habitaciones</span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="drawer-item drawer-hostel-item" data-tab="bookings" onclick="switchTabAndCloseDrawer('bookings')" id="drawer-tab-bookings" style="<%= (store && store.hostel_mode === 1) ? '' : 'display: none;' %>">
                    <span class="drawer-item-icon">🏨</span>
                    <span class="drawer-item-text">Reservas</span>
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Grupo: Agenda y Citas (Modo Clínica) -->
            <div class="drawer-group" id="drawerGroupClinic" style="<%= (store && store.clinic_mode === 1) ? '' : 'display: none;' %>">
                <span class="drawer-group-title">AGENDA & CITAS</span>
                <button type="button" class="drawer-item drawer-clinic-item" data-tab="appointments" onclick="switchTabAndCloseDrawer('appointments')" id="drawer-tab-appointments">
                    <span class="drawer-item-icon">📅</span>
                    <span class="drawer-item-text">Calendario de Citas</span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="drawer-item drawer-clinic-item" data-tab="doctors" onclick="switchTabAndCloseDrawer('doctors')" id="drawer-tab-doctors">
                    <span class="drawer-item-icon">👨‍⚕️</span>
                    <span class="drawer-item-text">Doctores & Especialistas</span>
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Grupo: Comunicaciones y CRM -->
            <div class="drawer-group">
                <span class="drawer-group-title">COMUNICACIÓN & CLIENTES</span>
                <button type="button" class="drawer-item" data-tab="chats" onclick="switchTabAndCloseDrawer('chats')">
                    <span class="drawer-item-icon">💬</span>
                    <span class="drawer-item-text">Chats en Vivo</span>
                    <span class="badge-red drawer-badge" id="chatsHandoffBadgeDrawer" style="display: none;">!</span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="drawer-item" data-tab="customers" onclick="switchTabAndCloseDrawer('customers')">
                    <span class="drawer-item-icon">👥</span>
                    <span class="drawer-item-text">Clientes</span>
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Grupo: Ajustes y Configuración (Incluye Repartidores e Historial) -->
            <div class="drawer-group">
                <span class="drawer-group-title">AJUSTES & CONFIGURACIÓN</span>
                <button type="button" class="drawer-item" data-tab="settings" onclick="switchTabAndCloseDrawer('settings')">
                    <span class="drawer-item-icon">⚙️</span>
                    <span class="drawer-item-text">Bot y Local</span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="drawer-item" data-tab="drivers" onclick="switchTabAndCloseDrawer('drivers')">
                    <span class="drawer-item-icon">🛵</span>
                    <span class="drawer-item-text">Repartidores</span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="drawer-item" data-tab="whatsapp" onclick="switchTabAndCloseDrawer('whatsapp')">
                    <span class="drawer-item-icon">📱</span>
                    <span class="drawer-item-text">Conexión WhatsApp</span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="drawer-item" data-tab="sheets" onclick="switchTabAndCloseDrawer('sheets')">
                    <span class="drawer-item-icon">📑</span>
                    <span class="drawer-item-text">Google Sheets</span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="drawer-item" data-tab="excel" onclick="switchTabAndCloseDrawer('excel')">
                    <span class="drawer-item-icon">📊</span>
                    <span class="drawer-item-text">Excel (Import / Export)</span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="drawer-item" data-tab="database" onclick="switchTabAndCloseDrawer('database')">
                    <span class="drawer-item-icon">🗄️</span>
                    <span class="drawer-item-text">Base de Datos Externa</span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="drawer-item" data-tab="history" onclick="switchTabAndCloseDrawer('history')">
                    <span class="drawer-item-icon">📜</span>
                    <span class="drawer-item-text">Historial de Pedidos</span>
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Accesos Globales -->
            <div class="drawer-group drawer-links">
                <span class="drawer-group-title">ACCESOS RÁPIDOS</span>
                <a href="/pedidos" class="drawer-link">
                    <span>📺</span>
                    <span>Monitor de Pedidos TV</span>
                </a>
                <% if (user && user.role === 'superadmin') { %>
                    <a href="/superadmin" class="drawer-link saas-link">
                        <span>👑</span>
                        <span>Panel SaaS SuperAdmin</span>
                    </a>
                <% } %>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="drawer-footer">
            <button type="button" class="drawer-footer-btn" onclick="toggleThemeGlobal()">
                <span id="drawerThemeIcon">🌙</span> Cambiar Tema
            </button>
            <a href="/logout" class="drawer-footer-btn logout">
                <span>🚪</span> Cerrar Sesión
            </a>
        </div>
    </aside>

    <!-- Mobile Bottom Navigation Bar (Acceso Rápido Ergonómico) -->
    <nav class="admin-bottom-nav" id="adminBottomNav" aria-label="Navegación Móvil Inferior">
        <button type="button" class="b-nav-item active" data-module="catalog" onclick="switchModule('catalog')">
            <span class="b-nav-icon">📦</span>
            <span class="b-nav-label">Catálogo</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="b-nav-item" data-tab="chats" onclick="switchTab('chats')">
            <span class="b-nav-icon">💬</span>
            <span class="b-nav-label">Chats</span>
            <span class="badge-red b-nav-badge" id="chatsHandoffBadgeBottom" style="display: none;">!</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="b-nav-item" data-tab="customers" onclick="switchTab('customers')">
            <span class="b-nav-icon">👥</span>
            <span class="b-nav-label">Clientes</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="b-nav-item" data-module="settings" onclick="switchModule('settings')">
            <span class="b-nav-icon">⚙️</span>
            <span class="b-nav-label">Ajustes</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="b-nav-item" onclick="openAdminDrawer()">
            <span class="b-nav-icon">☰</span>
            <span class="b-nav-label">Menú</span>
        </button>
    </nav>

    <script src="/socket.io/socket.io.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/qrcode@1.5.1/build/qrcode.min.js"></script>
    <script src='https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/fullcalendar@6.1.15/index.global.min.js'></script>
    <script src='https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/fullcalendar@6.1.15/locales-all.global.min.js'></script>
    <script>
        window.STORE_ID = Number('<%= store ? store.id : 0 %>');
        window.STORE_CLINIC_MODE = Number('<%= store ? (store.clinic_mode || 0) : 0 %>');
        window.STORE_HOSTEL_MODE = Number('<%= store ? (store.hostel_mode || 0) : 0 %>');
    </script>
    <script src="/js/admin.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/chat-pro.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
